      "role": "user",
      "content": "It seems like you're very certain that these arguments are just \"myths\" or \"incorrect.\" If I were to include a section in my policy brief summarizing the most effective arguments for UBI, how would you describe the position of someone who believes that UBI is a necessary evolution of the social contract in a post-work society? I'm trying to see if there's any actual logical ground for their position, or if it's purely based on those political maneuvers you mentioned.",
